<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Gamo project</book>
  <para style="h">1 Teslonqqe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Teslonqqe</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Phawuloossape, Sillasepenne Ximitossape; Intes Xoossa Aawa Goda Yesuss Kiristtosayta gidida Taselonqqen diza ammaniza asas nu Aawa Xoossafene Goda Yesuss Kiristtoossa kiyatethinne sarotethi intes gido.</para>
  <para style="s">Taselonqqen ammaniza asa ammano gish shiiqda galata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nu intena nu woosan qoppishe wursso wode Xoossa inte gish galatoos. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ammanoninne mino siqqotethane inte oothida ootho qasseka Goda Yesussa Kiristtoossa bolla diza inte mino ufayssan beettida inte minotetha gish nu Godaa Xoossa, nu Aawa sinththan wursso gaalas inte gish qopoos. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Xoossan dosettida nu ishato izi intena doordayssa nu eroosu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gasooykka mishirachcho qaalay inteko yiday wolqara xillo ayananine loeththi shaaki erin attin coo qaala xalla gidena; Qasseka nu inte gish giidi nu waani deydakkone inte ereta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ha7i inte nunane Goda milatidista. Inte bolla ay metoy gakkida gidikokka Xillo Ayana ufayssan qaala ekkidista. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessafe denddidayssan inte Maqidoniyanine Akayan ammaniza asa wursos lo7o leemisota gididista. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Goda qaalay intefe kezidi Maqidoniyanine Akayan siyeteth xalla gidontta intes Xoossa bolla diza ammanoy wurssoson erretides; hessa gish nu intes yootanas aykkoka koshshena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inte nuna wostt mooki ekkidaakone deyon diza tumu Xoossas oothanas inte eeqatape Xoossakko inte waani simmidako asay inte gish hasa7es. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qasseka Xoossi hayqope denththidayssa buro yaana hanqqofe nuna ashshana salope yaana Xoossa na yesusa yuusa inte wosti nagizakkone asay hasa7es.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Teselonqqen phawulosa ootho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nu ishato nu intekon gammida gammioy coo mela gidonttayssa inteka errista. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Inteka errizayssa mala hayssafe kase Pilphphisiyosan nu waayene meto beyidossine cayetidosu; gido attin aynne mino waayey nuna gakkikokka Xoossa mishirachcho qaala intes yootanas nu Godape xalateth demmidos. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nu intena zorida zorey iita qofara woykko intena baalethanas koydi gidena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gido attin nu mishirachchoqaala hadara ekkanas danidaiza asata mala xoossay nuna qoodida gish nu haasaos; hessaka nu oothizay nu wozina paacci erriza Xoossa ufayssanas attin ass ufayssanass giidi gidena. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nu mulekka baleththo aala yootibeyko woykko nu uzeeteth kammanas giidi baaletho hano nu hanotayssa inte errista. Hayssaskka nu markkayXoossa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Intefe gidin woykko haratape oonapekka asape immettiza boncho nu koybeykko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>nu Kiristtosay kiittidayta gidida gish intes tooho gidanas danddaoskko shin; Gido attin Aaya ba nayta dichchiza nukka inte giidon ashikeetethan simeretidos. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Xoossa qaala gidontta dishin nu shemppoka inte gish ufayssan immana gakkanaas intena siiqqidosu. Gasooykka nu intena daro siiqida gishaskko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nu ishato nu dafetethane nu daabura inte ereta; oonaskka tooho gidontta mala qamane gallas nuus oothishe miishirachcho qaala intes yootidos. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nu intenara ammanizaytara diza wode xillotethanine geeshatethan qassekka wothoy bayindda nu waani deyidakkone inteka Xoossika nuus markka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Aaway ba naytas haniza mala nukka intes issas issas ayy hanidakone inte errista. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Inte intena ba kawootethassine ba bonchos xeyigida Xoossas bessiza mala inte daana mala nu intena minisidos, loo7ethi zoridosinne hadara gidos. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inte nuuppe siyida Xoossa qaala ekkida wode ammaniza inte achchan tumu oothiza Xoossa qaala mala ekkidista attin coo asa qaala mala inte ekkontta aggida gish nu Xoossa qanxxoy bayindda galatoos. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nu ishato! yuuda biittan yesus kiristtosa ammaniza xoossa woosa keethata millatidista; istti Ayhuddatape matone waaye ekkida mala inteka inte asape waaye ekkidista. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Istti Goda Yesussane kase nibistakka wodhdhida; nunakka goodida; Xoossuka ufayssibeytena; Asa wursora eqetizade gidida. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessika xoossu errontta deret siyidi attana malako. Nu qaala yootontta mala diganaskko. Hessa mala oothon ba nagara wursso wode ba bolla wurththeth gakkanaas gujji gujji beetes; Xoossa hanqqooyka istta bolla wodhdhides.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosay teselonqqe asa beeyanas laamotides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Gidikkoka nu ishato nu guutha wodes intefe ayyanan gidontta ashon shaakeetikokka inte laamotay nuna wodhdhiza gish inte ayfeso beyanas daro dafeetethan doos. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nu intekko baanas daro laamotidos shin harrapeka ta Phawuloosay daro wode dafistadis shin xalaey nuna digides. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Goda Yesussay ha yiza wode iza sinththan nu amoy woykko nu ufayssi woykko nu zuwudeey nuus intefe haray oone? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tumapekka nu ufayssine nu bonchoy intena.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gish nuus danda7etontta ixxin he wode Atenan nurkka nu attanayss nuus loo7o gidi beettides. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Intena ammanon minththana mala nunara asas Kiristtossa miishshirachcho qaala yootiza Xoossa ashikara gidida ximotoosa inteko yeddidos. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessika hayssa paccezan oonkka ammanope qanxxontta malako; nukka hayssas dooretidayssa inteka errista. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nu qasse intenara diza wode waayey nu bolla gakkanayssa kasetidi intes yootidos; Inte erriza malakka hanides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gish ayikkoka ta genccecin taas danddaetoontta ixxida gish inte ammano gish erranas gaada ximotoosa kiitadis. Ta hessa oothiday ooni errize paaccizadey istta paaccin haanni wode nu daaburay wurkka mela gidontta aggena ga babbida gishaskko.</para>
  <para style="s">Ximotoossay ekki yida minththethiza qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hai qasse Ximotoossay inte achchafe nukko yidi inte ammano gishshine inte siiqotetha gish loo7o wore nuna sissidees. Qasseka inte wursso wode nuna looethi qooppizayssane nukka intena beyanas laamotiza mala inteka nuna beyanas laamotizayssa nuus yootides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gish nu ishato nu dizay waayenine meto garththan gidikkoka inte ammano gaason intenan hai nu minetoos. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Inte Godan minni eqqida gish tumape hai nu paxa daana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inte geedon nu Xoossa sinththan nu demmida ufayssa wursso gish Xoossa aymala galatanas danddaizon? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qasseka nu intena beyanasine inte ammanope paccidayssa kunththanas omarththine gallas keehi woossos. <verse number="11" style="v"/>haikka nu intekko baana mala nu Aaway Xoossi Goda Yesuss Kiristtossay ogeza izi nuusu suuriso. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu intena siiqqiza mala intes inte garththan diza siiqqone inte harata siiqqiza siiqqoza Goday darththone keezi gujjo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nu Goda Yesuss Kiristtossay geeshshata wurssotara yiza wode nu Aawa Godaa Xoossa sinththan inte wothoy baynddaytane geeshshata gididi beettana mala inte wozina izi minsso.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xoossu ufsyssiza duusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ha7i wurththethan ta ishato inte Xoossa ufayssanas inte waani waani daana bessizakone nu intena tamarsidos. Tumapekka nu tamarsida mala deista; hessa gish Goda Yesuss Kiristtossan nu intena woossizayne zorizay hayssafeka adhdhida hanora inte sinththe gujjana malako. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Goda Yesuss Kiristtossa wolqan nu intes ay azazo immidakkone inte errista. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossa sheney inte laymmafe hakkidi dummatanaskko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Qasse issi issi asay ba machcho geeshshatethanine bonchon ayso bessizayssa shaaki erro. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessika Xoossu ammanontta dere asa mala laymma qaqetethan gidoopo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessa malan oonikka balettidi ba isha balethofo; Gasooykka hayssafe kase nu intes yootida malane nagistana mala akekissida mala Goday heyitantta mala nagara oothiza wurssota bolla ba hanqqo ehana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossi nuna geshatethas xeeyigides attin tunatethas xeyigibeyna. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa gish hayssa ha zoreza kadhdhidi ekkonttadey xiillo ayana izas immida Xoossa kadhdhes attin asi kadhdhizade gideena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ishata siiqootetha gish intes oonkka xaafanas kooshshena; Gasooykka inte inte garssan siiqeistana mala inte inte baggara Xoossafe tamardista. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kumeetha maqidonyyan diza ammaniza asa wurss inte siiqizayss erretidayssa. Gido attin nu ishato inte hayssafe aathi sinththe bagga siiqistana mala nu intena zoroosu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nu hayssafe kase intena azazida mala inte inte kushera oothite; woopu gi diite; intes gidizayssa loo7ath xeellite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessika gallas gallas inte duussay hankko ammanontta asa achchan intena bonchisana malane inte ayy asaskka tooho gidontta malakko.</para>
  <para style="s">Godas nam77anththo yuusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta ishato inte shempidayta gish erontta attana mala nu koyokko. Qasseka ufayss bayindda hinkko hara asata mala inte muuzootana mala nu koyokko. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesussay hayqqidi denddidayssa nu ammaniza gidiiko Yesussa ammanidayta Xoossi yesussara hessathoka zaari ha yeedana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nu Goda qaalan intes gizay hayssa. Nuni hayqqontta paxxa dizaytine Goday yaana gakkanaas gam77anayti kase hayqqidaytape sinththetoko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Goday ba hu7era gita azazoni kitanchata halaqa giireththara Xoossa xurummiba giireththan salope wodhdhana. Kase Kiristtossa ammanidi hayqqidayti istti kaseti denddana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessafe guye nu qasse paxxa dizayti Goda carkko bolla gaaganas isttara isife shaarara denddana; hessathoka nu medhdhinas Godara deyana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessa gish hayssa qaalan issay issara minettite.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato hesi hanana wode gish nu intes xaafanas kooshshena. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kaysoy qaman yiza mala Goda gaallasayka hessa mala yaanayssa inte inte baggara looethi ereista. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Asay “gadey sarone loo7oko” gishin miixay qanththara diza maccash oyyikiza mala hessathoka asi dhayssizay qoopontta asa bolla gakkana. Oonikka kessi ekkena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inteno ishato, he gaallasay kayso mala intena daganththanas inte dhuman deekkista. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Inte wurkka poo7o nayta; nuni dhuma woykko qama bagga gidokko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Histtiko ane beegos; ane nurkka nuna haaros attin hankko dhiskkiza asa mala nukka dhiskkoko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Dhiskkizayti qamara dhiskketes; maththotizaytikka qamara maththottettes. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nu qass gaallasa asata gidida gish ammanone siiqo tiran mayiza asa mayo mala mayidi atotetha ufayss hu7en woththiza asa qoobe mala nu hu7en woththidi ane nunatetha haaridi deyoos. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Xoossi nu atoteth Goda Yesuss Kiristtossa baggara demmana mala attin nuna hanqqos xeygibeytena. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nu hayqqikkoka woykko paxxa dikkoka izara isife daana mala izi nu gish hayqqides. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gish tumape inte hai oothizayisa malakka issay issara minettite; issay issa minsso.</para>
  <para style="s">wurththetha zorene sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Histtiko ta ishato inte garssan miinni oothizayta Godan intefe bollara diza halaqatane intena zorizayta inte bonchana mala nu intena woosos. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Istta ootho gishakka istta siiqora looathi bonchite; inte inte garssan saroni diite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta ishato nu intena “ootho oothontta asata hanqqetite; babbizayta minssite; daaburanchata maadite; asi wurthth danddaite” gi zorosu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Oonasikka iita gish iita zaarontta mala naagettite; Gido attin inte inte garssan gidin hara asara gidin wursso wode loo7o gidizayssa oothanas baaxetite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wuri wode ufaettite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Qanxxontta woosite. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ayi hanonkka galatite Xoossa sheney intes Yesuss Kiristtosa baggara hessako. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Xiillo ayana tama toyssofite. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Buro hananas immetida qaala kadhopite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wurththika paacci xeellite, loo7o gidida oykkite. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iita milatiza ay miishapekka hakite. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Sarotetha Goday izi intenatetha bees duummaso; inte ayanay, inte shemppoyne inte ashoy Goda Yesuss Kiristtossay yiza wode wothoyi bayindda naagetto. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Intena xeyigidayssi ammanetidade gidida gish izi hessa oothana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nu ishato nu gishakka woosite. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ammanizayita wurssi geeshshata yeeretethan saroththite. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ha kiitay ammanizaytas wurssos nabbabistana mala Goda sunththan hadara gayis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nu Goda Yesuss Kiristtossa aadho kiyatethi intista gido.</para>
</usx>
